# gh-runnermaxxer targets
# Copy to .runnermaxxer.targets and list the repos/orgs to run runners for.
# One per line: owner/repo, org-name, or a full https://github.com/... URL.
# The startup menu shows these and lets you set a runner count for each;
# pressing 'a' there appends new entries to this file for you.
your-org/your-repo
your-org/another-repo
your-org
